OL,3,GNEWSACalls for 'disgusting' towpath to
OL,4,Abe cleaned
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeer bottles, tyres, broken furniture,
OL,7,Fempty propane cans, coffee cups, a
OL,8,Fcomputer monitor and full rubbish bags
OL,9,Fare among the eyesores that can be seen
OL,10,Fon a stretch of Thames Path in Reading.
OL,12,FGreen councillor David Clarke has
OL,13,Fcalled on the Environment Agency and
OL,14,FReading Borough Council to clear the
OL,15,Farea.
OL,17,FThe litter is centred around boats
OL,18,Fmoored on the riverside, some without
OL,19,Fthe authorisation of the local
OL,20,Fauthority.
